  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n1.345 + 13.45 + 0.1354 + 0.0596 = 11.453 - 0.543 + k\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nAdding the left-hand side:\n\n1.345 + 13.45 + 0.1354 + 0.0596 = 14.99\n\nSubtracting the right-hand side:\n\n11.453 - 0.543 = 10.91\n\nTherefore,\n\n14.99 = 10.91 + k\n\nk = 14.99 - 10.91\n\nk = 4.08\n\n**∴ The value of k is 4.08.**",
